{"id":1749083,"retrievedAt":"2026-08-14T12:04:40.382Z","response":{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":null,"belongs_to_collection":null,"budget":0,"genres":[],"homepage":"","id":1749083,"imdb_id":null,"origin_country":["US"],"original_language":"en","original_title":"Lelaki Kiriman Tuhan","overview":"# Translation  Naira is a fierce girl with a perpetually sour face. She does not believe in men who try to approach her. They are all insincere and like to take advantage. Men who claim to love her dearly will leave once they find out she has many family debts to bear. They do not seem genuinely loving her, unwilling to go through hardship together. Suddenly, a ghostly man appears and disrupts Naira's life. His name is Iqbal Raid. Raid is determined to win the heart of Naira, whose face looks sour, whose ego and arrogance are evident. Raid tries all sorts of ways to win Naira over. Raid is always there when Naira is in trouble and facing problems. He is willing to do anything, sacrifice everything for Naira and does not run away like other men. Eventually, it is the crooked and ghostly Raid that Naira misses. Unwilling to fall in love before marriage, Naira agrees to marry immediately despite objections from her own brother, Mirza.","popularity":0,"poster_path":"/aQRgKURq520HflgIgy5PDY4tgXs.jpg","production_companies":[],"production_countries":[],"release_date":"2018-01-01","revenue":0,"runtime":0,"softcore":false,"spoken_languages":[],"status":"Released","tagline":"","title":"Lelaki Kiriman Tuhan","video":false,"vote_average":0,"vote_count":0,"alternative_titles":{"titles":[]},"credits":{"cast":[{"adult":false,"gender":2,"id":1109288,"known_for_department":"Acting","name":"Remy Ishak","original_name":"Remy Ishak","popularity":0.8446,"profile_path":"/4bMvXJaCNXtF2xmji1xXqYmSoxI.jpg","cast_id":2,"character":"","credit_id":"6a7e7bb8c1aa893ad0b08bbb","order":0},{"adult":false,"gender":1,"id":1783272,"known_for_department":"Acting","name":"Mira Filzah","original_name":"Mira Filz